# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# --- Access control ---
# Strongly recommended once the app is deployed to a public URL. Unset means
# the whole app is wide open (fine for local dev; not fine for a shared
# link) — see middleware.ts. Gates every route except /api/webhooks/*, which
# already carry their own auth and must stay reachable by Google/Twilio.
# SITE_USERNAME=
# SITE_PASSWORD=

# Supabase — Project Settings > API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
# Server-only. Bypasses RLS. Never prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key

# DeepSeek — platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
# Optional. Defaults to deepseek-chat. deepseek-reasoner will not work here:
# it does not support function calling.
# PULSELINE_MODEL=deepseek-chat

# Optional. Traces of the agent's planning and subagent delegation, which are
# the clearest view into what the harness is actually doing.
# LANGSMITH_TRACING=true
# LANGSMITH_API_KEY=lsv2_...
# LANGSMITH_PROJECT=pulseline

# --- Live automation (Google Form -> WhatsApp -> reply loop) ---
# All optional. Absent means the two webhook routes and the whatsapp send
# step behave as documented no-ops (dispatch_status='skipped') -- local dev
# and `npm run verify` never need any of these set.

# Twilio — console.twilio.com. WhatsApp Sandbox is the practical choice for a
# demo; full WhatsApp Business API requires Meta business verification.
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=AC...
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=...
# TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM=+14155238886   # Sandbox number, no 'whatsapp:' prefix

# Required once either webhook is wired up. Must exactly match what Twilio's
# console and the Apps Script are configured to call -- used both to build
# the webhook URLs and to reconstruct the exact signed URL Twilio validates
# its signature against. See docs/twilio-sandbox-setup.md.
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app

# Shared secret the Google Apps Script sends as X-Pulseline-Webhook-Secret.
# Any long random string; generate one with `openssl rand -hex 32`.
# FORMS_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Campaign a form submission attaches to when the payload doesn't specify
# campaign_id itself. See docs/apps-script/README.md.
# LIVE_DEMO_CAMPAIGN_ID=44444444-4444-4444-8444-000000000004
